OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for people with
OL,4,A'unexplained burns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the attempted
OL,7,Fmurder of an 80-year-old woman are
OL,8,Furging people to report anyone seen
OL,9,Fwith "unexplained or suspicious burns"
OL,10,Fin the past 10 days.
OL,12,FDetectives said Brenda Raymond's family
OL,13,F"deserve answers" after she was
OL,14,F"deliberately set on fire" in a
OL,15,Fcommunal area of a block of flats in
OL,16,FCaractacus Cottage View, Watford, on 9
OL,17,FNovember.
OL,19,FDet Insp Adam Bridges said it was
OL,20,Fbelieved the offender was "likely to
OL,21,Fhave sustained injuries during the
OL,22,Fattack".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
